      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793281297222,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "This is an example of loop divergence: each thread reads its\nown loop count N from the array, using its thread index\nas the position. N is the value found here, not the\nposition.\n\nEach thread the runs the loop body A exactly N times.\n\nThreads in the same warp get different N, so they want\ndifferent numbers of rounds: control divergence, same idea\nas if-else, but now the paths differ in how many times\nthey go through A.\n\nThe warp runs A once per round for all 32 threads. A thread\nthat has finished its N rounds stays inactive while\nothers keep going. \n\nThe warps keep going until the thread with the LARGEST\nN is done. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "This is an example of loop divergence: each thread reads its\nown loop count N from the array, using its thread index\nas the position. N is the value found here, not the\nposition.\n\nEach thread the runs the loop body A exactly N times.\n\nThreads in the same warp get different N, so they want\ndifferent numbers of rounds: control divergence, same idea\nas if-else, but now the paths differ in how many times\nthey go through A.\n\nThe warp runs A once per round for all 32 threads. A thread\nthat has finished its N rounds stays inactive while\nothers keep going. \n\nThe warps keep going until the thread with the LARGEST\nN is done. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
